Where to check: binding.node's scope — each binding in analysis has .scope. Check binding.scope === target_function.metadata.scope or scope is within? Simpler: walk up binding.scope's parent chain to see if it includes target_function.metadata.scope? Binding scope for const inside function body: its scope parent chain reaches function scope. Let me check what EachBlock scope info exists. binding.scope exists for scoping. Condition:

